.Dd July 25, 2026
.Dt UCHAR.H 3HEAD
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm uchar.h
.Nd unicode utilities header
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In uchar.h
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.In uchar.h
header provides support for the C11 and C23 Unicode utilities.
The types and functions provide means for working with data encoded as
UTF-8, UTF-16, and UTF-32.
.Pp
The
.In uchar.h
header defines the following types:
.Bl -tag -width Vt
.It Vt char8_t
An unsigned integer that can represent 8-bit characters encoded in
UTF-8.
.It Vt char16_t
An unsigned integer that can represent 16-bit characters, generally a
single single UTF-16 code unit.
A Unicode code point may be one or two UTF-16 code units due to
surrogate pairs.
.It Vt char32_t
An unsigned integer that can represent 32-bit characters, generally a
single UTF-32 code unit.
.It Vt size_t
An unsigned integer that represents the size of various objects.
This can hold the result of the
.Sy sizeof
operator.
See also
.Xr stddef.h 3HEAD .
.It Vt mbstate_t
An object that holds the state for converting between character
sequences and wide characters
.Po
.Vt wchar_t ,
.Vt char16_t ,
.Vt char32_t
.Pc .
See also,
.Xr wchar.h 3HEAD .
.El
.Pp
The
.In uchar.h
header also defines the following functions which are used to convert
between
.Vt char8_t ,
.Vt char16_t ,
and
.Vt char32_t
sequences and other character sequences.
The functions that end in
.Sy _l
are extensions and not part of the C standard.
They take an arbitray locale to operate on rather than using the current
locale.
.Bl -tag -width cr16rtomb
.It Xr c8rtomb 3C , Xr cr8tomb_l 3C
Convert
.Vt char8_t
sequences to multi-byte character sequences.
.It Xr c16rtomb 3C , Xr cr16tomb_l 3C
Convert
.Vt char16_t
sequences to multi-byte character sequences.
.It Xr c32rtomb 3C , Xr cr32tomb_l 3C
Convert
.Vt char32_t
sequences to multi-byte character sequences.
.It Xr mbrtoc8 3C , Xr mbrtoc8_l 3C
Convert multi-byte character sequences to
.Vt char8_t
sequences.
.It Xr mbrtoc16 3C , Xr mbrtoc16_l 3C
Convert multi-byte character sequences to
.Vt char16_t
sequences.
.It Xr mbrtoc32 3C , Xr mbrtoc16_l 3C
Convert multi-byte character sequences to
.Vt char32_t
sequences.
.El
.Sh INTERFACE STABILITY
.Sy Committed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr c16rtomb 3C ,
.Xr c32rtomb 3C ,
.Xr mbrtoc16 3C ,
.Xr mbrtoc32 3C ,
.Xr stddef.h 3HEAD ,
.Xr wchar.h 3HEAD
